window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>The Leath are fighting for their Gods, but Bethany Anne is fighting for freedom.<br> <br> Then, the Leath make a very fatal mistake.<br> <br> On another planet, the Leath dishonor the Etheric Empire's warriors and Bethany Anne unleashes her new avatar and there will be hell to pay.<br> <br> For those that believe Might Makes Right, Bethany Anne is about to explain how that can be so, so wrong.<br> <br> Read the latest Bethany Anne adventure that can make you laugh out loud, shed a tear, and yell for the good guys as they fight evil in another galaxy.<br> <br> One ass-kicking at a time.<br> <br> Adapted from the novel and produced with a full cast of actors, immersive sound effects and cinematic music!<br> <br> Performed by Colleen Delany, Emily Beresford, Steve Wannall, Rita Amparita, Eric Messner, Ryan Dalusung, Christopher Graybill, Wayne LeGette, Mort Shelby, Matthew Pauli, James Lewis, Crystal Lee, Stephanie Nemeth-Parker, Danny Gavigan, Elena Anderson, Elizabeth Jernigan, Wyn Delano, Nicole Perez, Rayner Gabriel, Joey Sourlis, Chris Stinson, Mike Ciporkin, Elias Khalil, Belsheber Rusape, Triya Leong, Ren Kasey, Anthony Palmini, Bianca Bryan, Sara Matsui-Colby, Yenni Ann, Keval Shah, Sara Ruth Thomas, Lise Bruneau, David Cui Cui, Evan Casey, Daniel Llaca, Su Ling Chan, Jonathan Lee Taylor, Holly Adams, LaMont Ridgell, Rob Moreira, Eva Wilhelm, Amanda Forstrom, Matthew Schleigh, Marni Penning, Michael Glenn, Steven Carpenter, Jessica Threet, Terence Aselford, James Konicek, Bradley Foster Smith, Ken Jackson, Yasmin Tuazon, Christopher Williams, Emlyn McFarland, Drew Kopas, Laura C. Harris, Michael John Casey, Matthew Basset, David Zitney, Nora Achrati, Richard Rohan and Tyler Hyrchuk.</p>"; 
